 "slides": [
  {
   "title": "Pull *3 months* of statements",
   "body": "Download the last 3 months from your bank, every card and PayPal. Three months catches the charges that only show up <b>every other month or once a quarter</b>."
  },
  {
   "title": "Check your *app stores*",
   "body": "iPhone: <b>Settings, tap your name, Subscriptions</b>. Android: <b>Play Store, your profile icon, Payments and subscriptions, Subscriptions</b>. App charges often hide here."
  },
  {
   "title": "Let *Claude* find the leaks",
   "body": "Black out your card numbers, upload the statements and ask: <b>Find every recurring charge, including annual renewals and free trials that turned paid. Make a table with the yearly cost of each.</b>"
  },
  {
   "title": "Cancel where you *signed up*",
   "body": "A new card does not stop it: Visa can send your <b>new card number</b> to the company. Cancel in the app store or on the company's account page and <b>screenshot the confirmation</b>."
  },
  {
   "title": "Still charged? *Stop it*",
   "body": "Paid from your bank account? Tell your bank to stop the payment at least <b>3 business days</b> before it is due (they may charge a fee). On a credit card, dispute it in writing within <b>60 days</b> of the statement."
  }
 ],
